{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-08-04 14:23:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM REMINDS SHAREHOLDERS WITH LOSSES ON THEIR INVESTMENT IN WELLS FARGO & COMPANY OF CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE - WFC', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - AUGUST 4, 2022) - POMERANTZ LLP ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED AGAINST WELLS FARGO & COMPANY ("WELLS FARGO" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: WFC) AND CERTAIN OF ITS OFFICERS.'}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-08-04 05:45:00', 'title': 'WFC LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES WELLS FARGO & COMPANY INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , AUG. 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN WELLS FARGO & COMPANY ("WELLS FARGO" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: WFC) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT. CLASS DEFINITION: THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES ON BEHALF OF WELLS FARGO INVESTORS WHO WERE ADVERSELY AFFECTED BY ALLEGED SECURITIES FRAUD.'}